LEGAL["privacy"] = '''<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p class="upd">Last updated: November 6, 2026</p>
<p>This site is run by Idanatid (Ichay Sitbon, self-employed), web and app creation services. This document explains what data is collected on the site, why, and what your rights are. Questions: ichaysitsitbon@gmail.com or 058-788-4418.</p>
<h2>Data collected</h2>
<p><strong>Contact form.</strong> Name, phone, the offer you are interested in and your message. The form does not send anything to my servers: it opens a message ready to send in WhatsApp on your device, and the data only leaves if you press send. It is then also processed by WhatsApp (Meta) under its own policy.</p>
<p><strong>AI assistant (chat).</strong> The text you write and the page language are sent to my relay (Supabase, data center in Europe), then to a third-party AI provider (currently OpenRouter and the models it routes to; possibly Anthropic later) to produce the answer. I do not keep the content of conversations in a database. Technical logs (IP address, time, errors) may be kept by the infrastructure providers for a limited time. The IP address is also used to limit the number of messages. Please do not enter sensitive data, ID numbers or payment details in the chat.</p>
<p><strong>Cookies and local storage.</strong> The site uses your browser’s local storage (localStorage) to remember your language choice and the fact that you have read the cookie notice. This data stays on your device and is not sent to me. You can delete it at any time in your browser settings.</p>
<p><strong>Hosting and fonts.</strong> The site is hosted on GitHub Pages and the fonts are loaded from Google Fonts. Your IP address therefore reaches these providers, as with any browsing.</p>
<h2>What the site does not do</h2>
<p>No audience measurement tool, no advertising cookies, no visitor tracking for marketing.</p>
<h2>Why I use this data</h2>
<p>To answer your requests, prepare a quote, manage the business relationship, and run and improve the assistant. I do not sell personal data.</p>
<h2>Retention period</h2>
<p>WhatsApp messages and emails are kept for as long as needed to handle your request and the business relationship, and in line with my legal obligations. You can ask for their deletion at any time.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>Under the Israeli Privacy Protection Law (1981), you can view the data about you and ask for it to be corrected or deleted.</p>
<h2>How to request deletion of your data</h2>
<p>Write to me at ichaysitsitbon@gmail.com, on WhatsApp, or call 058-788-4418, saying which data to delete (for example, a message sent on WhatsApp or by email). I delete it and confirm to you, unless the law requires me to keep it. Data stored in your browser (language, cookie notice) can be deleted by you in the browser settings.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>I will update this document when the site or the way data is processed changes, and the date at the top will be changed.</p>'''
